{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "genji-modern",
  "chunk_id": "genji-modern-chunk-1890",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "她说了一大套话，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She said a great many things,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "但末摘花并没有真心的答辞，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but Suetsumuhana had no heartfelt reply,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "只是勉强应对道：“承蒙关念，无任欣幸。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and only forced herself to answer, “I am deeply grateful for your concern.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "妾身藐不足齿，岂能随驾远行？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I am too insignificant to be worth mentioning; how could I travel so far in your company?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "今后惟有与草木同朽耳。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "From now on I can only decay here together with the grass and trees.”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "姨母又说：“你这样想，确也难怪。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Her aunt said again, “It is no wonder that you think this way.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "但把一个活活的身体埋没在此，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But to bury your living body here like this,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "苦度岁月，恐是世人所不为的吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and pass the years in misery, is surely not what ordinary people would do.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "倘得源氏大将替你修理装潢，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If General Genji were to repair and refurbish your house for you,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "保管你这邸宅变成琼楼玉宇。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "this residence of yours would certainly become a jeweled palace.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "可是现在他除了兵部卿亲王的女儿紫姬之外，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But now, apart from Lady Murasaki, the daughter of the Prince of the Ministry of War,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "别无分心相爱的人了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "he has no one else with whom he shares his love.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "从前由于生性风流，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In the past, because he was naturally amorous,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "为求一时慰藉而私通的那些女人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "the women he secretly visited for a moment’s comfort",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "现在都绝交了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "have all been cut off from him now.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "何况像你那样褴褛龌龊地住在这荒草丛中的人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "All the more so for someone like you, living in rags and squalor among these wild grasses,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "要他顾念你坚贞不拔地为他守节而惠然来访，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "to expect him to remember your steadfast chastity and kindly come to visit you",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 18,
      "source_text": "恐是难乎其难之事了。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "would probably be almost impossible.”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 19,
      "source_text": "末摘花听了这话，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When Suetsumuhana heard these words,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 20,
      "source_text": "觉得确有道理，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "she felt that they were indeed reasonable,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 21,
      "source_text": "悲上心来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and sorrow welled up in her heart,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 22,
      "source_text": "便嘤嘤地哭个不住。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so she went on sobbing softly without stopping.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 23,
      "source_text": "然而她的心绝不动摇。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even so, her resolve did not waver at all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 24,
      "source_text": "姨母千言万语，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Her aunt exhausted every possible argument,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 25,
      "source_text": "终于劝她不服，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but in the end she could not persuade her,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 26,
      "source_text": "只得说道：“那么侍从总得让我带去。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and had no choice but to say, “Then at least you must let me take Jijū with me.”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 27,
      "source_text": "看看日色已暮，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Seeing that the light of day was already fading,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 28,
      "source_text": "急欲告辞动身。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "she was anxious to take her leave and set out.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 29,
      "source_text": "侍从周章狼狈，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Jijū was flustered and distraught,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 30,
      "source_text": "啼啼哭哭，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "crying and sobbing,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 31,
      "source_text": "悄悄地向小姐言道：“夫人今天如此诚恳，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and quietly said to her mistress, “Since my lady is so earnest today,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 32,
      "source_text": "我就且去送个行吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I shall go for the time being and see her off.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 33,
      "source_text": "夫人之言，当然有理；",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What my lady says is of course reasonable;",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 34,
      "source_text": "小姐踌躇不决，亦非无因。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and there is also a reason why you hesitate, my lady.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01890",
      "unit_index": 35,
      "source_text": "倒教我这中间人心烦意乱了！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is I, caught in the middle, whose heart and mind are thrown into confusion!”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
